{"lang":"zu","dir":"ltr","text":{"credits.donateTitle":"Siza ukugcina ukufunda kumahhala","credits.donateButton":"Sekela i-AOSSIE","credits.data":"Idatha","credits.photos":"Izithombe zezinhloko-dolobha","credits.otherPhotos":"Izithombe zezithelo, izilwane namaminerali","madeBy":"yenziwe ngu"},"html":{"credits.lead":"I-Memo iyisofthiwe yamahhala enekhodi evulekile. Yenziwe yinhlangano <a href=\"https://aossie.org/\">AOSSIE</a>.","credits.source":"Ikhodi yomthombo: <a href=\"https://github.com/AOSSIE-Org/Memo-EducationalGame\">github.com/AOSSIE-Org/Memo-EducationalGame</a>.","credits.donateText":"I-AOSSIE yinhlangano engenzi nzuzo. I-Memo ayinazo izikhangiso, ayinakho ukubhalisela okukhokhelwayo futhi ayiqoqi idatha yakho — futhi sifuna kuhlale kunjalo kuyo yonke ingane, yonke indawo. Uma i-Memo yenze izingane zakho zaba nelukuluku ngomhlaba, sicela ucabange ukusithengela ikhofi: wonke umnikelo, noma ngabe mncane kangakanani, usisiza ukwakha nokunakekela ezinye izinhlelo zokusebenza zemfundo zamahhala. Iminikelo yekhodi, imibono, ukuhumusha kanye nempendulo nayo yamukelwa ngokufanayo!","credits.shapes":"Izithombe zezimo: zidwetshelwe i-Memo, zingasetshenziswa mahhala njengayo yonke i-app.","credits.photoSets":"Izithombe zezithelo, izilwane namaminerali: zivela ku-<a href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/\">Wikimedia Commons</a>, zikhethwe nge-<a href=\"https://www.wikipedia.org/\">Wikipedia</a> ne-<a href=\"https://www.wikidata.org/\">Wikidata</a>; amagama azo kuzo zonke izilimi: <a href=\"https://www.wikidata.org/\">Wikidata</a> (CC0).","credits.flags":"Amafulegi: avela ohlelweni <a href=\"https://github.com/AOSSIE-Org/FlagQuiz\">Flag Quiz</a>, oluwathatha ku-<a href=\"https://github.com/hampusborgos/country-flags\">hampusborgos/country-flags</a> (asendaweni yomphakathi).","credits.capitals":"Izinhloko-dolobha nezithombe zazo: zivela ohlelweni <a href=\"https://github.com/AOSSIE-Org/FlagQuiz\">Flag Quiz</a>, oluzithatha emithonjeni elandelayo: <a href=\"https://www.wi